# Never commit per-instance data — it's personal/PHI (diet.md) and large (the restaurant DB).
# Instances live at ~/.local/state/dietician-app/instances/<person>/ by default; these patterns are a
# defense-in-depth backstop in case a store/import is ever pointed into the package tree.
instances/
_import-src/
data/
site/
*.kml
root.swiss
instances.json
node_modules/
